{{!-- META {"path":"date-picker","title":"Date and time picker","description":"One attribute turns a text input into a calendar in the site's colours: a date, a two-month range, a date with a time slider, or just the time. More attributes set bounds, steps, the week start and the language.","parent":"showcase","order":6,"data":{"icon":"calendar-dots","preset":"contours"}} --}}
{{> page-hero parent=page.parent}}

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
    <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">01 · One line</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="d1_title">A date field.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="d1_lead">Put the marker on a text input. Click the field and the calendar opens below it; the chosen day is written back into the input, so it submits like any other field. The input itself is styled by the platform in both themes.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-sm">

<label class="block">
  <span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Pick a date</span>
  <input type="text" name="day" data-sw-component="datetimepicker" placeholder="Select a date" class="w-full" />
</label>

      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">date picker · one line</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;label</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"block"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Pick a date<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;input</span> <span class="tk-attr">type</span>=<span class="tk-str">"text"</span> <span class="tk-attr">name</span>=<span class="tk-str">"day"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"datetimepicker"</span> <span class="tk-attr">placeholder</span>=<span class="tk-str">"Select a date"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"w-full"</span> <span class="tk-tag">/&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/label</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">02 · Modes</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="d2_title">Range, date and time, or just the time.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="d2_lead"><code class="font-code text-base">data-mode</code> picks the variant. A range opens as two months side by side, so a span across a month boundary is one gesture. Time modes add a slider; <code class="font-code text-base">data-time-step</code> sets its minute step and <code class="font-code text-base">data-time-format</code> picks a 24-hour or a 12-hour clock.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6 sm:grid-cols-3">

<label class="block">
  <span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Stay</span>
  <input type="text" name="stay" data-sw-component="datetimepicker" data-mode="range" placeholder="Arrival – departure" class="w-full" />
</label>
<label class="block">
  <span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Appointment</span>
  <input type="text" name="appointment" data-sw-component="datetimepicker" data-mode="datetime" data-time-step="15" data-time-format="HH:mm" placeholder="Date and time" class="w-full" />
</label>
<label class="block">
  <span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Call me at</span>
  <input type="text" name="call" data-sw-component="datetimepicker" data-mode="time" data-time-format="hh:mm aa" data-time-step="30" placeholder="Time" class="w-full" />
</label>

    </div>
    <div class="mt-6">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">date picker · modes</span></div>
