<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/label</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;label</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"block"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Appointment<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;input</span> <span class="tk-attr">type</span>=<span class="tk-str">"text"</span> <span class="tk-attr">name</span>=<span class="tk-str">"appointment"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"datetimepicker"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-mode</span>=<span class="tk-str">"datetime"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-time-step</span>=<span class="tk-str">"15"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-time-format</span>=<span class="tk-str">"HH:mm"</span> <span class="tk-attr">placeholder</span>=<span class="tk-str">"Date and time"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"w-full"</span> <span class="tk-tag">/&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/label</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;label</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"block"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Call me at<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;input</span> <span class="tk-attr">type</span>=<span class="tk-str">"text"</span> <span class="tk-attr">name</span>=<span class="tk-str">"call"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"datetimepicker"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-mode</span>=<span class="tk-str">"time"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-time-format</span>=<span class="tk-str">"hh:mm aa"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-time-step</span>=<span class="tk-str">"30"</span> <span class="tk-attr">placeholder</span>=<span class="tk-str">"Time"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"w-full"</span> <span class="tk-tag">/&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/label</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">03 · Always open</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="d3_title">A calendar in the page.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="d3_lead">Put the marker on a block element instead of an input and the calendar stays open in the page flow. <code class="font-code text-base">data-months</code> widens it. Below: a two-month range on the left, and on the right a calendar that collects several separate dates, with weeks starting on Sunday.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-6">
    <div class="max-w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-3">

<div data-sw-component="datetimepicker" data-mode="range" data-months="2"></div>

    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-3">

<div data-sw-component="datetimepicker" data-multiple="true" data-first-day="0"></div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="min-w-0">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">date picker · inline range</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"datetimepicker"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-mode</span>=<span class="tk-str">"range"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-months</span>=<span class="tk-str">"2"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">date picker · several dates</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"datetimepicker"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-multiple</span>=<span class="tk-str">"true"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-first-day</span>=<span class="tk-str">"0"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
      <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
        <p class="ws-index ws-ink">04 · Language</p>
        <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="d4_title">Month names follow the page.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="d4_lead">The picker reads the page's language, so a translated page gets translated month and weekday names with no extra work. English, German and Spanish are built in. <code class="font-code text-base">data-locale</code> forces one; this field is German on an English page.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-sm">

<label class="block">
  <span class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold">Termin</span>
  <input type="text" name="termin" data-sw-component="datetimepicker" data-locale="de" placeholder="Datum wählen" class="w-full" />
</label>

        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">date picker · locale</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;label</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"block"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Termin<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;input</span> <span class="tk-attr">type</span>=<span class="tk-str">"text"</span> <span class="tk-attr">name</span>=<span class="tk-str">"termin"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"datetimepicker"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-locale</span>=<span class="tk-str">"de"</span> <span class="tk-attr">placeholder</span>=<span class="tk-str">"Datum wählen"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"w-full"</span> <span class="tk-tag">/&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/label</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">Reference</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl" data-sw-text="ref_title">The other attributes.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100">
    <table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th>Attribute</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td class="whitespace-nowrap font-code text-sm">data-min · data-max</td><td>The first and last selectable day, as <code class="font-code text-sm">YYYY-MM-DD</code>. Days outside are disabled.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="whitespace-nowrap font-code text-sm">data-first-day</td><td>The first weekday column, 0 for Sunday to 6 for Saturday. Defaults to the language's convention.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="whitespace-nowrap font-code text-sm">data-multiple</td><td>Lets the visitor pick any number of separate dates. Not combined with a range.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="whitespace-nowrap font-code text-sm">data-position</td><td>Where the popup opens, for example <code class="font-code text-sm">bottom left</code>, <code class="font-code text-sm">top center</code> or <code class="font-code text-sm">auto</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="whitespace-nowrap font-code text-sm">data-months</td><td>Months side by side, 2 to 12. A range shows two by default.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Without JavaScript every field stays a plain text input that still takes a typed value and still submits. The date, time and datetime field types of the form builder render as this picker. Use a text input, not <code class="font-code">type="date"</code>, or the browser's own picker opens as well. The calendar is Vanilla Calendar Pro, shipped only to pages that use it.</p>
</section>

<section class="border-t border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 class="ws-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">More of the showcase</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="{{sw-url '/showcase'}}">All demos {{sw-icon "arrow-right" "h-4 w-4"}}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {{#each pages.showcase._attributes.children}}
      {{#unless (eq path @root.page.path)}}
      <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-4" href="{{sw-url path}}">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-heading font-semibold">{{#if data.icon}}{{sw-icon data.icon "h-4 w-4 ws-ink"}}{{/if}}{{title}}</span>
      </a>
      {{/unless}}
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
